# CardDemo Security Remediation Patch — Shareable
# Apply from project root: git apply analysis/CardDemo/security_remediation.patch
# Credential hunks are in security_remediation.local.patch (gitignored; not for sharing).
#
# NOTE on IDOR findings (SEC-015/016/017/018):
#   UserEntity has no FK to CustomerEntity/AccountEntity. Until a user→account ownership
#   link is added to the schema, these patches restrict account/card/billing/transaction
#   access to ROLE_ADMIN as a temporary guard. See SECURITY_FINDINGS.md for the
#   production remediation path (add customer_id to app_user table + OwnershipService).

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SEC-004: Never send stored password to 3270 update screen (two hunks in COUSR02C.cbl)
# Hunk 1: remove the MOVE SEC-USR-PWD to screen field in PROCESS-ENTER-KEY
# Hunk 2: change the WHEN PASSWDI=SPACES branch to CONTINUE (not an error),
#          since the blank field now means "keep existing" not "user forgot to type"
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
diff --git a/legacy/CardDemo/app/cbl/COUSR02C.cbl b/legacy/CardDemo/app/cbl/COUSR02C.cbl
--- a/legacy/CardDemo/app/cbl/COUSR02C.cbl
+++ b/legacy/CardDemo/app/cbl/COUSR02C.cbl
@@ -166,7 +166,8 @@
            IF NOT ERR-FLG-ON
                MOVE SEC-USR-FNAME      TO FNAMEI    OF COUSR2AI
                MOVE SEC-USR-LNAME      TO LNAMEI    OF COUSR2AI
-               MOVE SEC-USR-PWD        TO PASSWDI   OF COUSR2AI
+      *    SEC-004: password field left blank intentionally — never pre-populate.
+      *    Blank PASSWDI on the update screen now means "keep existing password".
                MOVE SEC-USR-TYPE       TO USRTYPEI  OF COUSR2AI
                PERFORM SEND-USRUPD-SCREEN
            END-IF.
@@ -198,8 +199,7 @@
               WHEN PASSWDI OF COUSR2AI = SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
-                  MOVE 'Y'     TO WS-ERR-FLG
-                  MOVE 'Password can NOT be empty...' TO
-                                  WS-MESSAGE
-                  MOVE -1       TO PASSWDL OF COUSR2AI
-                  PERFORM SEND-USRUPD-SCREEN
+      *    SEC-004: blank = keep existing stored password; not an error after pre-fill removed.
+                  CONTINUE

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SEC-009: Assert CDEMO-USRTYP-ADMIN in CICS admin programs
#
# COUSR01C and COUSR02C use RETURN-TO-PREV-SCREEN (not RETURN-TO-SIGNON-SCREEN).
# The admin check must go INSIDE the ELSE branch, AFTER the COMMAREA is copied,
# so that CDEMO-USRTYP-ADMIN is readable from CARDDEMO-COMMAREA.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
diff --git a/legacy/CardDemo/app/cbl/COUSR01C.cbl b/legacy/CardDemo/app/cbl/COUSR01C.cbl
--- a/legacy/CardDemo/app/cbl/COUSR01C.cbl
+++ b/legacy/CardDemo/app/cbl/COUSR01C.cbl
@@ -78,6 +78,12 @@
            IF EIBCALEN = 0
                MOVE 'COSGN00C' TO CDEMO-TO-PROGRAM
                PERFORM RETURN-TO-PREV-SCREEN
            ELSE
                MOVE DFHCOMMAREA(1:EIBCALEN) TO CARDDEMO-COMMAREA
+      *    SEC-009: EIBCALEN > 0 does not prove admin role — check COMMAREA explicitly.
+      *    Must appear after COMMAREA copy so CDEMO-USRTYP-ADMIN is populated.
+               IF NOT CDEMO-USRTYP-ADMIN
+                   MOVE 'COSGN00C' TO CDEMO-TO-PROGRAM
+                   PERFORM RETURN-TO-PREV-SCREEN
+               END-IF
                IF NOT CDEMO-PGM-REENTER

